[{"id":3940485823,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7q3wq_","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?u=74caa4e396a8e2995ac648a80f7488601d679e63&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","login":"Alex2782","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782"},"body":"OK for `--headless`, but unnecessary in the export dialog (too much text). Perhaps we should also check if the editor is running in headless mode; that would be the simplest option (not tested).\n\n```cpp\n\tString display_driver = GLOBAL_GET(\"display/display_server/driver\");\n\tif (display_driver == \"headless\") {\n\t\t....\n\t}\n\n```\n\n--------\n### Export Dialog\n\n<img width=\"1628\" height=\"164\" alt=\"Bildschirmfoto 2026-03-12 um 23 48 07\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cc84185e-b8bb-40b1-9ff9-e13433b5e913\" />\n\n\n### --headless\n```\nbin/godot.macos.editor.arm64 -e --path ~/Downloads/Test --headless  --export-debug Android ~/Downloads/test.apk\n\nERROR: Cannot export project with preset \"Android\" due to configuration errors:\nETC2/ASTC texture compression is required for Android export. In Project Settings, search for 'ETC' in the search field, or enable 'Advanced Settings' and go to Rendering > Textures > VRAM Compression to enable 'Import ETC2 ASTC'.\nThe project name does not meet the requirement for the package name format and will be updated to \"noname\". Please explicitly specify the package name if needed.\n\n   at: _fs_changed (editor/editor_node.cpp:1392)\nERROR: Project export for preset \"Android\" failed.\n   at: _fs_changed (editor/editor_node.cpp:1408)\n```","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117341#pullrequestreview-394048